tps://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":118280555,"digest":"sha256:28b65874dd2c6bbf26cbd1078f9e4c38c12cb332e6e44b85632e1022450bb31c","download_count":14,"created_at":"2026-05-21T22:35:28Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T22:36:49Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.5.0/Advancely-v1.5.0-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.5.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.5.0","body":"### The inspiration for this release came from working on a `Blaze and Caves` template, and having an easier time seeing which advancements/criteria got added/changed with a new BAC release.\r\n\r\nSo this update includes a lot of quality of life features to make working within the Template Editor even more enjoyable!\r\n\r\n> [Devlog of this release! (Fully Chapterized)](https://youtu.be/89zBnL55pKg)\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n### The features of this release include, but are not limited to:\r\n\r\n#### Template editor (the big stuff)\r\n- Cross-template imports on all 7 main tabs (`Advancements`, `Stats`, `Unlocks`, `Custom`, `Counters`, Multi-Stage`, Decorations`) and on per-parent imports (`criteria`, `sub-stats`, `stages`).\r\n- Template update helpers in the player-file advancement import: `...new advancements`, `...renames` (basename + ≥80% criteria-overlap detection), `...stale`, `...criteria differences`.\r\n- Advancement criteria grouping so advancements like **Blaze and Caves' \"Ultimate Enchanter\"** can count multiple criteria as one shared progress unit (book and regular enchant).\r\n- **Bulk actions** consolidated under one button across all 10 lists: bulk delete, reorder, icon-path change, and manual layout positioning (with automatic grid placement on bulk move).\r\n- Templates carry a built-in `Display Category` field; every official template updated.\r\n\r\n#### Cross-template import polish\r\n- Language dropdown picks which source-zip lang file feeds the imported display names.\r\n- Yellow warning when imported items have linked_goals / arrow / parent_advancement refs that won't resolve in the destination.\r\n- Search bars on the 4 nested helper popups (New / Renames / Stale / Criteria differences) with Ctrl+F focus, and a `Crit. Search` toggle on the criteria-differences popup.\r\n\r\n #### Other Fixes\r\n- 1.12 - 1.12.2 root-name format checks corrected on imports (advancements need `:`, stats must not).\r\n- Unsaved-changes popup no longer flickers when the import popup is open.\r\n- Relay connection requires matching latest version; direct (LAN) connection only needs matching versions.\r\n- Coop player face now part of the text bounding box, respecting left/center/right anchor.\r\n- Creating a new template then reverting no longer leaves the editor in a stuck/garbage state.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}